  "problem": "$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n}{2}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n}{2}x)\n$$\n\nThe Fourier series of the $4\\pi $-periodic extension $f(x)$ of the function \n\n$$\nF(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}5, & x\\in [0,2\\pi ) \\\\ -2, & x\\in [-2\\pi ,0)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nis shown above. Find the exact value of ${b}_{3}.$\n\n${b}_{3}=$ {{field-1}}",
